#: pyblocks/snippets/pybricks/randomness.py:6
msgid ""
"Choose a random integer, including both limits.\n"
"\n"
"Supported on Inventor, SPIKE Prime and Technic hubs.\n"
"BOOST Move Hub firmware does not include urandom."
msgstr ""
"Выбрать случайное целое число, включая обе границы.\n"
"\n"
"Работает на хабах Inventor, SPIKE Prime и Technic.\n"
"В прошивке BOOST Move Hub нет модуля urandom."

#: pyblocks/snippets/pybricks/randomness.py:17
msgid ""
"Choose a random item from a nonempty sequence.\n"
"\n"
"Available on Inventor, SPIKE Prime and Technic hubs; not on BOOST."
msgstr ""
"Выбрать случайный элемент непустой последовательности.\n"
"\n"
"Доступно на Inventor, SPIKE Prime и Technic; недоступно на BOOST."

